<title>POLAND: Polish shares end higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine stocks rose, five fell and six were flat in 13.8-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday.</p>
<p>The remaining two stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 1.7 percent to 146.5 zlotys in an 18.2-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
